[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-IRS004
TITLE: Phrase text is the notation and byte encoding is not selected
STATEMENT: >>>
The normative external notation of a transmission shall be the rendered phrase string. The in-memory port shall pass the transmission object and that phrase. No radio modulation, socket framing, or line encoding shall be selected in this increment. Acceptance is a round trip of a rendered request back to the same kind, runway, and registration, with the phrase unchanged.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A later plan can choose a carriage without rewriting the phrase set.
<<<
DAL: E
